              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MrsDiaz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great base recipe! I used what veggies I had in the fridge and it turned out tasty. Even my husband who doesn't like vegetables at all approved of this soup. My only change was to sautee three cloves of garlic along with the onions and celery. Other than that....yummy!",
