              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "tmh347"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this recipe for a fellowship meal at church--everyone loved it and my container was completely emptied! I couldn't find fresh chives so I used freeze-dried and also added some cayenne pepper to kick up the taste a bit. Excellent recipe, Stacy A.!",
            "datePublished": "2007-04-04T19:43:30.507Z"
          },
